s crucial for managing network infrastructure, and structured cabling practices, guided by TIA standards, facilitate this. Patch panels are key components in this organizational structure, enabling efficient management and termination of network cables. By segmenting and organizing cabling, patch panels simplify network maintenance, troubleshooting, and future expansions. The TIA's emphasis on structured cabling inherently promotes better organization of network infrastructure [Data: Entities (181), Relationships (236,+more)].\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"Balanced cables and patch cords specifications\",\n            \"explanation\": \"Balanced cables are a type of cable used in telecommunications, and TIA standards provide specifications for their use, including requirements for patch cords. These standards ensure that the connections made by patch cords maintain the signal integrity and performance of the balanced cabling system. This detail highlights the comprehensive nature of TIA's standards, extending to the specific components that link different parts of the network infrastructure [Data: Entities (174), Relationships (240,+more)].\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"rating\": 7.0,\n    \"rating_explanation\": \"The impact severity rating is high due to the foundational and widespread nature of TIA standards in global telecommunications infrastructure, affecting millions of commercial installations.\"\n}", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": null, "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null, "provider_specific_fields": {"refusal": null, "reasoning": null}}, "provider_specific_fields": {"native_finish_reason": "STOP"}}], "created": 1787604354, "model": "google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite", "object": "chat.completion", "moderation": null, "service_tier": "default", "system_fingerprint": null, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 1056, "prompt_tokens": 2873, "total_tokens": 3929, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_predicti